   "brief": "Design an extraordinary 850 m\u00b2 modern tropical luxury mansion on a spacious, completely flat private estate.\nThe home should feel like a world-class architect designed it specifically for this property\u2014not a generic modern house or a collection of rectangular boxes.\nARCHITECTURE\nCreate a sophisticated two-storey mansion with six bedrooms, multiple interconnected wings, a dramatic double-height entrance, impressive rooflines, and a clear hierarchy between the main living pavilion, private bedroom wings, and secondary spaces.\nUse beautifully balanced proportions, deep roof overhangs, varied building depths, architectural columns, recessed glazing, and intentional transitions between indoor and outdoor spaces.\nDESIGN CHARACTER\nContemporary Caribbean resort architecture inspired by exceptional tropical luxury residences. Combine warm natural stone, timber accents, textured concrete, bronze or dark-framed glass, and carefully placed architectural lighting.\nPrioritize coherent materials, realistic construction, and thoughtful facade detailing.\nOUTDOOR LIVING\nDesign a spectacular resort-style swimming pool integrated with the main living terrace, expansive covered outdoor lounges, a landscaped courtyard, tropical gardens, a formal arrival driveway, and a striking main entrance.\nArrange the wings to create beautiful outdoor spaces rather than simply placing everything in a straight line.\nARCHITECTURAL QUALITY\nEvery wing, roof, window, balcony, entrance, and outdoor area should feel intentionally designed as part of one cohesive residence.\nCreate a memorable arrival experience and an equally impressive garden/pool-facing facade.\nThe final result should feel like a real multimillion-dollar Caribbean estate.\nSITE\nCompletely flat land at elevation zero. No slopes, cliffs, retaining walls, mountains, or terrain elevation changes.\nFocus the complexity and creativity on the architecture itself.",
